<title>USA: Innkeepers USA files for 8.6 mln shr offer.</title>
<headline>Innkeepers USA files for 8.6 mln shr offer.</headline>
<dateline>PALM BEACH, Fla. 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Innkeepers USA Trust said Friday it filed a registration statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission for a public offering of 8.6 million common shares, exclusive of an over-allotment option of 1.29 million common.</p>
<p>The offering is expected to commence in October, the company said.  </p>
<p>Montgomery Street Income Securities Inc, Bear Stearns &amp; Co Inc, Alex. Brown &amp; Sons Inc, Everen Securities Inc and Morgan Keegan &amp; Co Inc will be the managing underwriters.</p>
</text>
